ISO-10303-21;
/* Hea009: ADVANCED_FACE on PLANE with FACE_OUTER_BOUND using degree-2 B_SPLINE_CURVE_WITH_KNOTS (6 ctrl pts, knot-mults (3,3,3) at (0.0,0.5,1.0)); internal C0 knot at u=0.5 (mult=3=degree+1 produces C^-1 break); not a single Bezier segment; must be split by ShapeUpgrade_ShapeConvertToBezier; wrapped in GEOMETRIC_CURVE_SET → TransferRoots yields empty; OCC silently accepts; spec-kernel must heal/reject */
